      <description>&lt;table cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;vertical-align: middle; padding-right: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43864057?s=96&amp;amp;v=4&quot; width=&quot;96&quot; height=&quot;96&quot; alt=&quot;@HaveAGitGat&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0; padding: 0; border-radius: 50%;&quot; /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/HaveAGitGat&quot;&gt;@HaveAGitGat&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;Transcoding applications&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;132&lt;/strong&gt; followers · &lt;strong&gt;2&lt;/strong&gt; following&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;list-style-type: none; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/link.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;link&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 8px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://tdarr.io&quot;&gt;https://tdarr.io&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Popular Repository&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/HaveAGitGat/Tdarr&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tdarr&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;4.3k &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;122&lt;br&gt;Tdarr - Distributed transcode automation using FFmpeg/HandBrake + Audio/Video library analytics + video health checking (Windows, macOS, …&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Other Repositories (Popular)&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/HaveAGitGat/HBBatchBeast&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HBBatchBeast&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;708 &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;57&lt;br&gt;A free GUI application for HandBrake and FFmpeg/FFprobe with an emphasis on batch conversion (including recursive folder scans and folder watching) -Windows, macOS, Linux &amp;amp; Docker&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/HaveAGitGat/Tdarr_Plugins&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tdarr_Plugins&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;223 &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;242&lt;br&gt;Tdarr Plugins&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/HaveAGitGat/Tdarr_Plugin_s7x9_winsome_h265_10bit&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tdarr_Plugin_s7x9_winsome_h265_10bit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;4 &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;0&lt;br&gt;This plugin transcodes all videos to h265 10 bit (if not in h265 already) and remuxes if not in mkv. If the English language track is not in AC3,EAC3 or DTS then an AC3 track is added.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/HaveAGitGat/Tdarr_Plugin_e3jc_Tharic_H.264_MKV_480p30_No_Subs_No_Title_Meta&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tdarr_Plugin_e3jc_Tharic_H.264_MKV_480p30_No_Subs_No_Title_Meta&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;4 &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;1&lt;br&gt;This plugin removes subs, metadata (if a title exists) and makes sure the video is h264 480p mkv.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/HaveAGitGat/Tdarr_Plugin_x7ac_Remove_Closed_Captions&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tdarr_Plugin_x7ac_Remove_Closed_Captions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;3 &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;0&lt;br&gt;If detected, closed captions (XDS,608,708) will be removed.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/HaveAGitGat/Tdarr_Plugin_s710_nick_h265_nvenc_4K&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tdarr_Plugin_s710_nick_h265_nvenc_4K&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;2 &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;0&lt;br&gt;This plugin transcodes all 4K videos to h265 using nvenc (if not in h265 already). For 4K and files in other resolutions: If not in mkv the file is remuxed into mkv. If the English language track is not in AC3,EAC3 or DTS then an AC3 track is added.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
      
